{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Pro Tips for Using Pipelines\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 1.\tx360\tab {\b Don\u8217't skip steps} - Each mnemonic builds on the previous one\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 2.\tx360\tab {\b Document at each stage} - Your STOP insights inform TRACE, TRACE data feeds DEBUG, etc.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 3.\tx360\tab {\b Know when to branch} - If IDEA reveals complexity, switch to ICEBERG \u8594 ? 5 Whys\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 4.\tx360\tab {\b Combine with stress tools} - Always start with STOP if you\u8217're emotionally activated\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 5.\tx360\tab {\b Teach your team} - Shared vocabulary accelerates collaboration\sa180\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Common Mistakes to Avoid\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Jumping to Solutions\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Problem:} Skipping STOP or WAIT when stressed \u8594 ? poor decisions\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Fix:} Always use STOP first in crises, WAIT before reacting in conflicts\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Example:} {\i Production alert at 2 AM - Jumping straight to SSH without STOP \u8594 ? panic-driven wrong server reboot \u8594 ? extended downtime. Instead: STOP (30 seconds) \u8594 ? assess severity \u8594 ? then TRACE}\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Using Wrong Pipeline\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Problem:} IDEA won\u8217't solve systemic issues\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Fix:} Use ICEBERG \u8594 ? 5 Whys for recurring problems\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Example:} {\i Database timeouts happen weekly - Using IDEA to restart service each time \u8594 ? problem returns. Instead: ICEBERG \u8594 ? 5 Whys reveals missing connection pool config \u8594 ? permanent fix}\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Incomplete Execution\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Problem:} Starting 8D Approach but stopping at D3 (band-aid)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Fix:} Always reach D7 (Prevent Reoccurrence) or the problem returns\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Solo Hero Mode\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Problem:} Forgetting RACI \u8594 ? no accountability when you\u8217're unavailable\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Fix:} Use RACI in 8D Approach\u8217's D1 (Form a team)\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Analysis Paralysis\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Problem:} PREPARE \u8594 ? ICEBERG \u8594 ? 5 Whys \u8594 ? 8D for simple problems\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Fix:} Start with IDEA, escalate only if complexity emerges\par}
